---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Comments from '../../../components/Comments.astro';

---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Project Management for Construction and Aviation - Caleb McGennis"
  description="BXP builds AI project management software for construction and aviation businesses: custom tools shaped around how your team already works, not the other way around."
  type="article"
  publishedTime="2026-11-23"
  author="Caleb Michael McGennis"
  image="/images/social/bxp-ai-project-management-construction-aviation-og.jpg"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-soho-white py-20 md:py-32 px-4 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <a href="/blog/entrepreneur-ai" class="inline-flex items-center text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors mb-8">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to An Entrepreneur in a World of AI
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-display font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">
        AI Project Management for Construction and Aviation
      </h1>
      <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-brass-horizontal rounded-full shadow-sm mb-8"></div>
      <p class="text-2xl text-gray-500 font-light mb-8">What BXP builds, and why it starts with how your team already works.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-gray-500">
        <span>By Caleb Michael McGennis</span>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <time datetime="2026-11-23">November 23, 2026</time>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article Content -->
  <article class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl prose prose-lg">
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 font-light">
        At <a href="https://www.aibexp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors underline">BXP</a> (Business Experience), we build AI project management software for construction and aviation businesses. I want to explain what that means, who it's for, and how we go about it.
      </p>

      <figure class="my-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm not-prose">
        <img loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" src="/images/bxp/bxp-home.webp" alt="The BXP home page with the headline Business Growth Through Expert Consulting" class="w-full" />
        <figcaption class="p-4 bg-soho-white text-sm text-gray-600 font-light">The BXP home page at aibexp.com</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Full disclosure: BXP is my company, so I'm biased. I'll stick to what we do and how we work.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Why Construction and Aviation</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Construction and aviation look different from the outside, but they run on a lot of the same things: schedules, crews, vendors, documents, inspections, and budgets that all have to line up. When one piece slips, everything downstream feels it. And in both industries, a lot of that work still lives in spreadsheets, email threads, paper, and somebody's memory.
      </p>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        That's exactly where project management software earns its keep, and where AI can take real work off people's plates.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Built Around Your Team, Not the Other Way Around</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Off-the-shelf tools ask your team to change how they work to fit the software. We go the other direction. BXP builds custom applications, automation tools, and integrations shaped around how your business already runs, and that scale with it as you grow.
      </p>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        The AI part isn't there to replace your people. It's there to handle the busywork that slows them down, so your project managers spend their time managing projects instead of chasing paperwork.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">How We Work</h2>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>It starts with a free consultation.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Detailed quotes and milestone-based payments.</strong> You get a detailed quote after the consultation, with no hidden fees.</li>
        <li><strong>Shared ownership of the code.</strong> We use a collaborative approach with dual ownership of the source code.</li>
        <li><strong>A tech stack that fits you.</strong> Built with modern technologies tailored to your business needs and goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Support after launch.</strong> Flexible support packages keep things running long-term.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Beyond software, BXP also does business strategy and planning, professional websites, and technology consulting.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Try the Free Tools First</h2>

      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        If you're not ready to talk yet, BXP has a few free tools you can use on your own:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-6 text-gray-600 space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.aibexp.com/tools/software-roi-calculator" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors underline">Custom Software ROI Calculator</a>: put in your numbers and see a cost-benefit analysis for custom software.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.aibexp.com/tools/growth-readiness-assessment" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors underline">Business Growth Readiness Assessment</a>: a 15-question quiz with a personalized action plan.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.aibexp.com/tools/revenue-leak-analyzer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-gold transition-colors underline">Website Revenue Leak Analyzer</a></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="bg-mcgennis-navy text-white rounded-xl p-8 my-12 not-prose">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">Talk to BXP</h3>
        <p class="text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
          If you run a construction or aviation business and your projects live in too many places, <a href="https://www.aibexp.com/#contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-mcgennis-gold">book a free consultation</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@aibexp.com" class="underline hover:text-mcgennis-gold">info@aibexp.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Comments />

  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto text-center">
      <a href="/blog/entrepreneur-ai" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-gray-300 text-gray-700 font-medium tracking-wide hover:border-mcgennis-navy hover:text-mcgennis-navy transition-all duration-300">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to An Entrepreneur in a World of AI
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
